  "limitations": [
    "Final BERT checkpoint (model.pt) could not be included due to Kaggle GPU quota limits and corrupted downloads.",
    "Full fine-tuning on 3.5M rows was not feasible; a deterministic 10% subset was used.",
    "Semi-supervised pseudo-labeling did not improve over the control model, due to class imbalance in the accepted pseudo-labels (92.9% recommended)."
